  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iQlGHUt.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZapGEPqm2V\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1173075408556654592?style=flat-square&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=orange&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=white&amp;color=gray\" alt=\"\" width=\"79\" height=\"20\"></a><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong>關於</strong></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p><pre><strong>CoolCatLib 是我所有模組運行所需的核心庫，它讓我開發模組變得非常容易。</strong><br><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:10px\"><em><strong>注意：此模組是為滿足我個人需求而設計，並非供其他開發者使用。</strong></em></span><br><span style=\"color:#800000\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:10px\">不過，歡迎大家根據自身需求，自由調整我的任何實作內容。</span><br><br></strong></em></span></pre><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><strong><span style=\"color:#808080\">⟪</span> <em>特色功能</em> <span style=\"color:#808080\">⟫</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#333\"><strong>適用於 Fabric 的釀造配方註冊</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#333\"><strong><strong>大量的輔助類別</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#333\"><strong><strong>以及更多...</strong></strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong>翻譯</strong></em></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p><p><strong>您可以透過造訪專案的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fcoolcatlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin 連結</a> 來協助我進行翻譯！</strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>支援語言：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#808080\"><em><strong>英文</strong></em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#808080\"><em><strong>阿拉伯文</strong></em></span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p>",
